EXT. DRIVE-IN MOVIE SCREEN - ROOFTOP - NIGHT

Five teenagers crowd the rusted catwalk behind a giant blank screen. The city glows beyond.

                    JUNO
          You said you'd bring the keys.

                    MATEO
          I said I'd try.

                    JUNO
          That's not what you said.

                    OLUWASEUN
          Guys, quiet. Someone's down there.

                    PRIYA
          It's just the security guy.

                    MATEO
          It's never just the security guy.

                    JUNO
          He's walking this way. Move.

They all lurch at once. Mateo collides with Priya, Oluwaseun drops his flashlight, and Dani, silent until now, grabs Juno's sleeve. The flashlight rolls off the catwalk and clatters below.

                    DANI
          (whisper)
          I'm not going back.

                    JUNO
          Nobody's going back. Hush.

A beam of light sweeps across the screen. The five freeze. The light lingers, then slides away.

Juno exhales. Mateo lets go of Priya's arm. Oluwaseun laughs without sound. Dani lets go of the sleeve.
